# Local development protocol

This repo is the HP Demo Day prototype UI (Next.js). Cursor setups follow `LOCAL-DEV.md` and `.cursor/skills/local-startup/SKILL.md`.

## Default

- Working directory: this app root (`package.json` here).
- Start: `npm run dev`
- UI: http://localhost:3000
- Auth: local only. Auto-signed in as Local Developer.

## Never on localhost

- Trimble Identity / `id.trimble.com`
- `TID_CLIENT_SECRET` in `.env.local`
- Registering a localhost TID callback
- Committing UI work directly to `main`

## Always

- Copy `.env.local.example` → `.env.local` if missing (`AUTH_MODE=local`)
- Feature branch (`ui/`, `feat/`, `fix/`), then PR to `main` for VM deploy
